			"y": 705.5574298695144,
			"text": "Go HTTP2:\n  go_http2Server_processHeaders (请求)\n  go_http2Client_writeHeaders (响应)\n\nGo TLS:\n  go_tls_read_enter / go_tls_write_exit\n\nOpenSSL:\n  SSL_read / SSL_write\n\ngRPC:\n  grpc_internal_transport_*",
			"fontSize": 9,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Go HTTP2:\n  go_http2Server_processHeaders (请求)\n  go_http2Client_writeHeaders (响应)\n\nGo TLS:\n  go_tls_read_enter / go_tls_write_exit\n\nOpenSSL:\n  SSL_read / SSL_write\n\ngRPC:\n  grpc_internal_transport_*",
